{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p style=\"text-align: left;\">劉兆銘離世｜演藝界泰斗劉兆銘（Ming Sir）昨日與世長辭，享年94歲。縱橫演藝界超過半世紀的 Ming Sir，一生為觀眾演活了無數膾炙人口的經典角色。無論是正派、反派還是破格的妖物演出，他都能拿捏得游刃有餘，每一個角色都深深烙印在觀眾心中。</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\">在電視圈，Ming Sir 塑造了多個風格迥異且深得民心的經典人物！</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: -webkit-standard;\">1983年《射雕英雄傳之華山論劍》飾「段智興」</span></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: -webkit-standard;\">「冤冤相報何時了」</span></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\"><br/> <div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\"><br/> <img alt=\"740b831f-c24a-4119-8206-851b4ba92f71.jpg.webp\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/file/2026/09/20263Y7UuuUnSR1788416584.webp\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"740b831f-c24a-4119-8206-851b4ba92f71.jpg.webp\"/><br/> </div><br/></div><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: -webkit-standard;\">1984年《新紮師兄》飾「張福成」</span></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: -webkit-standard;\">「原來你當年陀住個肚嚟夾硬逼我食死貓係咪！」</span></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\"><br/> <div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\"><br/> <img alt=\"ee04dae6-f06e-40e9-841a-d563c17c9c05.jpg.webp\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/file/2026/09/2026nHgjiJhZES1788416585.webp\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"ee04dae6-f06e-40e9-841a-d563c17c9c05.jpg.webp\"/><br/> </div><br/></div><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: -webkit-standard;\">1984年 《鹿鼎記》飾「海大富」</span></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\"><br/> <div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\"><br/> <img alt=\"c1db72b4-d2ee-42f3-98ff-784692fc1cd8.png.webp\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/file/2026/09/20269U2EFiCrif1788416585.webp\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"c1db72b4-d2ee-42f3-98ff-784692fc1cd8.png.webp\"/><br/> </div><br/></div><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: -webkit-standard;\">1987年《倩女幽魂》「姥姥」</span></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: -webkit-standard;\">「天底下的男人，個個都是好色之徒，外面的男人沒一個好東西！」</span></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\"><br/> <div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\"><br/> <img alt=\"d2cbf2c2-463d-4eca-9293-0908db37affa.jpg.webp\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/file/2026/09/2026Jf1QL5B1Hj1788417044.webp\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"d2cbf2c2-463d-4eca-9293-0908db37affa.jpg.webp\"/><br/> </div><br/></div><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: -webkit-standard;\">2017年《賭城群英會》飾「屠城」</span></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\"><br/> <div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\"><br/> <img alt=\"e213969a-ea7c-4b1f-b061-d23417a09fce.jpeg.webp\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/file/2026/09/2026V75v0SvcAu1788416585.webp\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"e213969a-ea7c-4b1f-b061-d23417a09fce.jpeg.webp\"/><br/> </div><br/></div><p style=\"text-align: left;\"><br/></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-09-03T07:04:04.820458+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":316,"images":5,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none"}}